---
// The span ids and the trace id are from the p10_spans.py capture in section 4.
// clue-api's outgoing GET span has span_id 0xf89387690f8010c4; evidence-lab's
// server span names it as parent_id. The traceparent header carries that link.
const W = 900, H = 330;
---
<figure class="bep10p">
  <div class="bep10p-scroll">
  <svg viewBox={`0 0 ${W} ${H}`} role="img" aria-label="Two services. clue-api's outgoing GET span, span id 0xf89387690f8010c4, sends a traceparent header carrying the trace id and that span id across the network. evidence-lab's span GET /analyze/case_id reads it and records parent_id 0xf89387690f8010c4, drawn in red, so both spans sit in the same trace.">
    <text x="40" y="44" class="h"><tspan data-lang-en>clue-api</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>clue-api</tspan></text>
    <rect x="40" y="62" width="340" height="62" rx="8" class="box" />
    <text x="60" y="88" class="b"><tspan data-lang-en>GET (outgoing call)</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>GET (cuộc gọi đi)</tspan></text>
    <text x="60" y="110" class="m"><tspan data-lang-en>span_id 0xf89387690f8010c4</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>span_id 0xf89387690f8010c4</tspan></text>
    <line x1="210" y1="124" x2="210" y2="188" class="lnr" />
    <polygon points="204,186 210,200 216,186" class="arrowr" />
    <text x="232" y="158" class="r"><tspan data-lang-en>traceparent header: trace_id + this span_id</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>header traceparent: trace_id + span_id này</tspan></text>
    <text x="40" y="238" class="h"><tspan data-lang-en>evidence-lab</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>evidence-lab</tspan></text>
    <rect x="40" y="250" width="420" height="62" rx="8" class="boxr" />
    <text x="60" y="276" class="b"><tspan data-lang-en>GET /analyze/{'{'}case_id{'}'}</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>GET /analyze/{'{'}case_id{'}'}</tspan></text>
    <text x="60" y="298" class="r"><tspan data-lang-en>parent_id 0xf89387690f8010c4</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>parent_id 0xf89387690f8010c4</tspan></text>
    <text x="500" y="276" class="m"><tspan data-lang-en>same trace_id 0xcd8693ca…</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>cùng trace_id 0xcd8693ca…</tspan></text>
    <text x="500" y="298" class="m"><tspan data-lang-en>without the header: two unrelated one-span traces</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>không có header: hai trace rời nhau, mỗi trace một span</tspan></text>
  </svg>
  </div>
  <figcaption>
    <span data-lang-en>The header is the join. The second service records which span called it, and that is how the table of seven spans becomes one tree.</span>
    <span data-lang-vi>Header chính là chỗ nối. Service thứ hai ghi lại span nào đã gọi nó, và nhờ vậy bảng bảy span thành một cái cây.</span>
  </figcaption>
</figure>

<style>
  .bep10p { margin: 2em 0; width: 100%; }
  .bep10p-scroll { overflow-x: auto; }
  .bep10p svg { display: block; width: 100%; min-width: 640px; height: auto; }
  .bep10p text { font-size: 14px; fill: var(--text-body); font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; }
  .bep10p .h { font-weight: 700; fill: var(--text); font-size: 15px; }
  .bep10p .m { fill: var(--text-muted); font-size: 13px; }
  .bep10p .b { font-weight: 700; fill: var(--text); }
  .bep10p .r { fill: var(--red); font-weight: 700; }
  .bep10p .box { fill: var(--bg-alt); stroke: var(--border); stroke-width: 1.4; }
  .bep10p .boxr { fill: var(--red-tint-bg); stroke: var(--red); stroke-width: 1.6; }
  .bep10p .ln { stroke: var(--text-faint); stroke-width: 1.4; }
  .bep10p .lnr { stroke: var(--red); stroke-width: 1.6; }
  .bep10p .axis { stroke: var(--border); stroke-width: 2; }
  .bep10p .arrow { fill: var(--text-faint); }
  .bep10p .arrowr { fill: var(--red); }
  .bep10p figcaption { margin-top: 10px; font-size: 14px; color: var(--text-muted); line-height: 1.55; text-align: center; }
</style>
